{"v":4,"catch":"輕鬆上手的麻將遊戲！\n一台遊戲機即可與朋友進行兩人對戰！","desc":"HANDY麻將，是一款採用日本麻將規則、容易輕鬆上手的經典桌上型麻將遊戲。\n在兩人模式（兩人對戰）下，可隱藏自機的手牌，進行對戰。\n即使是初學者也可以輕鬆享受麻將的樂趣，另外遊戲內還準備了「玩法」、「役一欄表」、「專門用語集」以供參考。","publisher":"ITL","release":"2025-12-25","genres":["桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c9760fd99fd013b9df56738ad4426d70b6216e9f838eb73b935237fceacaa36.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9fd03ee6146c1dc6097ce9bf808aa338936f86835e18630368069efdecbed3b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae4e86d19be8299e8dd721781bf93e9adeefb55185d29332c6afcde6999f6e68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61cfde2ccacfed1f12956558a920bb9df9962e0b559bbe5e68e94df4a235b436.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b1f7277965afaa62cbfbc408f47c5bc41d966e872a1cbffa42533978a187d5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee1445a89b7773ecb14cf35736615d43a4a0543d34240957f92b3634e752d5aa.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c8e0083c4000","dlc":[]}